title: The Police Raid
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and c_police_timer <= 0 and time >= 2
on-arrival: {!
Q.c_police_timer = 4;
Q.month_actions += 1;
// the raid falls where the party is strongest
var best = Q.districts[0];
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    if (Q['district_' + d + '_members'] * (0.5 + Math.random()) > Q['district_' + best + '_members']) {
        best = d;
    }
}
Q.c_police_district = best;
Q.c_police_district_name = Q.district_names[best];
!}
frequency: 150
is-card: true
tags: germany

= The Police Raid

At dawn, [? if time < 15 : Noske's troops and the police ?][? if time >= 15 : the Security Police of Carl Severing's Prussian interior ministry, or their colleagues in the other states, ?] raid the party offices in **[+ c_police_district_name +]**. They take the membership files, the typewriters and the district secretary. The papers say they found plans for an uprising. Our comrades say they found the minutes of a dues committee.

- @protest: Protest in the streets.
- @illegal: Build an illegal apparatus beside the legal party.
- @legal: Fight it in the courts and the parliaments.
- @easy_discard

@protest
subtitle: Thousands march. The district is proud; the police are ready.
on-arrival: {!
var d = Q.c_police_district;
Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] += 5;
Q.militancy += 4;
Q.repression += 3;
Q.offensive_satisfaction += 3;
Q.lean_offensive += 1;
!}

The district calls out the factories. The march passes the police headquarters in silence, and then not in silence.

@illegal
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. Duplicate files, hidden presses, cover addresses. The party is harder to strike.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
var d = Q.c_police_district;
Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] += 3;
Q.repression -= 4;
Q.red_guards_loyalty += 3;
Q.unity += 2;
!}

The next raid will find empty cupboards. The membership lists are copied by hand and kept in three places nobody writes down.

@legal
subtitle: Complaints, questions in parliament, a lawsuit. Slow, but it keeps the party legal.
on-arrival: {!
Q.repression -= (Q.kpd_seats > 0) ? 4 : 3;
Q.militancy -= 2;
Q.luxemburgist_satisfaction += 2;
Q.unionist_satisfaction += 2;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
!}

Our lawyers file complaints and [? if kpd_seats > 0 : our deputies ?][? if kpd_seats = 0 : friendly Independent deputies ?] ask questions in parliament. Months later, the typewriters come back.
